# Task: Write User Stories

## Goal
Convert an approved Clarified Requirement into a set of INVEST-
compliant user stories with Gherkin acceptance criteria.

## Steps
1. Break the requirement into multiple independent stories if needed —
   do not create one giant story.
2. Each story must follow:
   > **As a** [persona], **I want** [goal], **so that** [benefit].
3. Apply INVEST (see shared  BA-Standards.instruction) — add a one-line INVEST
   self-check per story.
4. Write acceptance criteria in Gherkin (Given/When/Then), covering
   happy path, at least one alternate/edge case, and at least one
   negative/error case (where applicable).
5. Add Priority (High/Medium/Low), Assumptions (if any), and Out of
   scope (if any) per story.

## Output format (Markdown)
Numbered list of user stories, each with: Story, INVEST check,
Acceptance Criteria, Priority, Assumptions, Out of scope.